Sparky Stereo OS (ORDER 50 step 5, with ORDER 46 row 50e): the 3D area's five sentences (Enable 3D, 3D display settings..., the two flat notices, the settings failure) in the eight other languages: de, es, fr, ja, ko, pl, zh_CN, zh_TW (patch 0002, Stereo3D_LANG.properties beside the English and pt_BR ones). "Enable 3D" and "3D display settings..." are the edition's words from KiCad's catalogue (row 50d).
